Read [AGENTS.md](../AGENTS.md) and follow it.

Non-negotiable:
- Every file is capped at 50 lines. Split by ownership before adding.
- [docs/](../docs/README.md) are implementation contracts. Update docs and
  code in the same change.
- No fake product behavior, placeholder success, or unrun gate claims.
- Repository files store durable state; chat does not.

Start every session from [docs/current-state.md](../docs/current-state.md),
then [docs/execution/current-blockers.md](../docs/execution/current-blockers.md).

Run `python scripts/check-all.py` before handoff when docs or scripts changed.
